        "PMC6926650::rubric_card::000::747f75bd64"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed SPS treatment is conducted in an inert atmosphere.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An SPS condition around 1200 °C with a dwell time of minutes can provide rapid densification while limiting excessive atomic diffusion.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6926650::rubric_card::000::747f75bd64"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPS suppresses grain coarsening and produces grain refinement.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPS stabilizes desired nanoscale precipitates or metastable phases.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rapid SPS thermal cycles minimize grain growth and undesirable phase transformations.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The high heating rate and short exposure alter diffusion kinetics to produce a refined, near-equilibrium microstructure and promote phase stability.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Precipitation strengthening and grain-boundary strengthening improve the strength of SPS-processed alloys.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::rubric_card::000::c40db9eaa7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPS will produce a uniform, fine-grained bulk alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPS will produce controlled precipitate morphology.",
