        "PMC7513042::rubric_card::000::c40db9eaa7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Traditional casting or slow sintering tends to produce coarse grains, broader phase distributions, and lower mechanical performance.",
      "field": "baseline",
